sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant I as Identity
    participant DB as Identity DB
    actor R as Resident
    A->>FE: Create resident account
    FE->>I: POST /admin/users + JWT (block, roomNumber)
    I->>DB: User + ActivationCode, one transaction
    I-->>FE: 201 User + one-time code
    A-->>R: Personally hand login and activation code
    R->>FE: Code + own password
    FE->>I: POST /auth/activate
    I->>DB: Validate code, set password hash, consume code atomically
    I-->>FE: 204
    FE->>I: POST /auth/login
    I-->>FE: 200 JWT + User
